#
# Who may add, remove or change a seat's lock, in Sutra. role is the acting
# seat's role and target the role of the seat whose lock changes (1 owner,
# 2 person, 3 guest); own is 1 when that seat is the actor's own, else 0.
# An owner may change any lock; a person only their own; a guest never has
# a lock, so no one gives one a lock and a guest changes none. A role or a
# flag past 9, or a negative one, does not fit its picture: refused.
record seat-rights
  role: 9
  own: 9
  target: 9
procedure
  if target < 1 or target > 2 or own > 1
    answer 0 = 1
  end-if
  answer role = 1 or role = 2 and own = 1
